<title>LATVIA: TABLE-LATVIA JULY CPI UP 0.5 PCT, YR/YR 7.7.</title>
<headline>TABLE-LATVIA JULY CPI UP 0.5 PCT, YR/YR 7.7.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Latvian July consumer prices rose 0.5 percent and was up 7.7 percent year-over-year, the statistics committee said on Thursday.  LATVIAN CPI		     July '97    June '97    July '96</p>
<p> Month-on-month change (pct) +0.5	  +0.2	  +0.3</p>
<p> Year-on-year change (pct)   +7.7	  +7.5	 +17.7</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
